				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our community event room accommodates up to 60 guests, making it an ideal space for workshops, presentations, networking and  events.</p><p class="p1">With its welcoming atmosphere and flexible layout, the space can be easily adapted to suit a wide range of events and occasions.</p>								</div>
