				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Are you looking for a quiet yet central place? Our coworking hall is a flexible and inspiring space that can be transformed to accommodate smaller or bigger crowds, for professional events, presentations, or gatherings. On weekends the space is available for exclusive hire in the heart of the city.</p>								</div>
