				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>If you need an urgent booking (in 2 working days), please contact us via phone at </strong><span style="text-decoration-line: underline;"><a href="tel:+36302016035">+36 30 </a></span><span style="text-decoration-line: underline;">201 6035</span><strong> or email at <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><em>budapest@impacthub.net</em></span>. Otherwise we will contact you within 48 hours after we receive your booking request. Plase wait for our confirmation to finalize your booking.</strong></p>								</div>
