beginning and ending of your event (for example 09:00-17:30)</span><span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_text">(Required)</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_text'><input name='input_23' id='input_8_23' type='text' value='' class='large'     aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false"   /></div></div><div id="field_8_24" class="gfield gfield--type-text gfield--input-type-text gfield--width-full gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_above gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible" data-group-id="79538a7a" data-field-span="12"><label id='gfield_label_8_24' class='gfield_label gform-field-label' for='input_8_24'><span class='gform-field-label__text'>How many participants do you expect at the event?</span><span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_text">(Required)</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_text'><input name='input_24' id='input_8_24' type='text' value='' class='large'     aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false"   /></div></div><div id="field_8_26" class="gfield gfield--type-text gfield--input-type-text gfield--width-full gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_above gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible" data-group-id="dd5f466c" data-field-span="12"><label id='gfield_label_8_26' class='gfield_label gform-field-label' for='input_8_26'><span class='gform-field-label__text'>How much time do you need for load-in and load-out before and after the event? (Room setup will be handled by us as requested.)</span><span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_text">(Required)</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_text'><input name='input_26' id='input_8_26' type='text' value='' class='large'     aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false"   /></div></div><div id="field_8_10" class="gfield gfield--type-select gfield--input-type-select gfield--width-full gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_above gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible" data-group-id="70cc0c69" data-field-span="12"><label id='gfield_label_8_10' class='gfield_label gform-field-label' for='input_8_10'><span class='gform-field-label__text'>How would you like the space to be set up?</span><span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_text">(Required)</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_select'><select name='input_10' id='input_8_10' class='large gfield_select'    aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false" ><option value='' selected='selected' class='gf_placeholder'>Choose a set-up</option><option value='Theatre-style seating (chairs in rows)' >Theatre-style seating (chairs in rows)</option><option value='Chairs in a circle (no tables)' >Chairs in a circle (no tables)</option><option value='Classroom / table setup (tables with chairs)' >Classroom / table setup (tables with chairs)</option><option value='Other (please describe in the “Additional message” field)' >Other (please describe in the “Additional message” field)</option></select></div></div><div id="field_8_25" class="gfield gfield--type-text gfield--input-type-text gfield--width-full gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_above gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible" data-group-id="e02c9236" data-field-span="12"><label id='gfield_label_8_25' class='gfield_label gform-field-label' for='input_8_25'><span class='gform-field-label__text'>What is the topic of your event in short?</span><span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_text">(Required)</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_text'><input name='input_25' id='input_8_25' type='text' value='' class='large'     aria-required="true" aria-in